## Summary
Canada has announced retaliatory tariffs on hundreds of US products, escalating an ongoing trade dispute with Washington. The move comes as tensions between Ottawa and the Trump administration continue to deepen over trade policy.

## Key Points
- Ottawa has imposed new tariffs targeting hundreds of American products
- The tariffs are explicitly retaliatory in nature, responding to prior US trade actions
- The move signals a deepening trade war between Canada and the United States


